# The production picker closed with OK: the mark moved to the third cell (Network Node) with a click, OK chooses it and the base screen's
# production changes (the base is part of the state compared). See prodpicker.scene for how it is opened. Leave time after each step; the
# snaps take 2 s each.
# The leaders' portraits in the base screen animate on their own slow clock.
mask 266 625 310 678
mask 702 624 760 680
mask 318 98 708 295      # the map of the base screen, whose terrain can come out in two looks
25 load
48 click 362 734         # the note's Close
55 key b                 # found a base where the colony pod stands
64 key Return            # its base screen
68 state pp_sel 0x6b27b8 12
72 click 175 723         # CHANGE
76 move 600 420
80 snap open
82 click 510 120         # the third cell
86 snap marked
88 click 561 515         # OK
96 snap ok
98 close
